<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-005" chapter-id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals" source-id="s-songshu-005-wangyi-annals-ws2370105">
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三月乙丑，左將軍、徐州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p001:m0013" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">王仲德</persName>進號安北將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三月戊子，遣右將軍<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p002:m0009" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9">到彥之</persName>北伐，水軍入河。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">戊寅，金墉城為索虜所陷。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十一月癸未，虎牢城復為索虜所陷。壬辰，遣征南大將軍<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p004:m0025" ref="w8z_nph_trk">檀道濟</persName>北討，右將軍<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p004:m0034" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9">到彥之</persName>自滑臺奔退。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">辛酉，滑臺為索虜所陷。癸酉，征南大將軍<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p005:m0019" ref="w8z_nph_trk">檀道濟</persName>引軍還。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p006" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">秋七月戊辰，以尚書<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p006:m0009" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">王仲德</persName>為鎮北將軍、徐州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p007" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">鎮北將軍、徐州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p007:m0009" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">王仲德</persName>加領兗州刺史</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p008" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏五月戊辰，鎮北將軍、徐兗二州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p008:m0017" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">王仲德</persName>進號鎮北大將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p009" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">辛卯，鎮北大將軍、徐州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p009:m0013" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">王仲德</persName>卒。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p010" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">壬辰，以右衞將軍<persName id="c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p010:m0008" ref="f08_59c_1b9">劉遵考</persName>為徐、兗二州刺史。</p>
</text>
